    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it just feels like it's not that simple though. i see the way they struggle, the way they look at me when i'm exhausted or when things are tight, and i just feel this overwhelming sense that i'm getting in the way of them actually having a good life. like, if i wasn't constantly dragging them down with my own failures and my own sadness, maybe they could actually breathe. i feel like a parasite.",
