      "content": "but that's what's so hard... every little thing i do to \"take care of myself\" just costs more money, or more energy, or just more time that i should be spending making things better for them. it feels like a zero-sum game. i'm just consuming resources that they need. if i could just... i don't know. if i wasn't here, they wouldn't have to deal with my mess or my exhaustion. they could actually start fresh without me dragging them down.",
